{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":235558,"ns":0,"title":"Denying the correlative","extract":"The informal fallacy of denying the correlative is an attempt made at introducing alternatives where there are none.  It is the opposite of the false dilemma, which is denying other alternatives.","description":"Attempt made at introducing alternatives where there are none","descriptionsource":"local"}]}}